WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.570
<v Dana, security desk>In January, one in three clicked our drill.

2
00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:06.900
<v Dana, security desk>By May, after monthly drills, one in five.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:11.500
<v Dana, security desk>Where were clicks by November, do you think? Draw the rest of the line.

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.520
<v Dana, security desk>Every team clicks less than in January.

5
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:21.470
<v Dana, security desk>Finance, sales and HR fell to 3 or 4 percent. IT started low.

6
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:27.080
<v Dana, security desk>The warehouse started highest, at 41 percent, and still clicks most.
